<Group labelreference="L478" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">That is, the first equation allows you to calculate <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtSSNtbkdGJDYlUSIxRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRidGMkY1RjgvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y1RkE=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtSSNtbkdGJDYlUSIxRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRidGMkY1RjgvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y1RkE=</Equation>, which can then be used in the second to give you <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>, etc. This is the general form of an explicit Runge-Kutta <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiTUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEiTUYnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnRjIvRjZRJ25vcm1hbEYn</Equation>-stage stencil. It is traditional (but not necessary) to also set <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>, resulting in the following Butcher tableau.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L466" drawlabel="true">
