<Group labelreference="L498" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">We could have also obtained this by using the <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">indets</Font> function to find all the indeterminant quantities (all symbols that have not been assigned a value) in the Butcher tableau.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L492" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">unknowns := indets(Butcher);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSl1bmtub3duc0dGKDwnSSFHRigmSSZhbHBoYUdGKDYkIiIjIiIiJkkiYkdGKDYjRjQmRjY2I0YzJkkiY0dGKEY5NyNGLg==</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L497" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Actually, this returns the set we want with the extra element <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">``</Font> corresponding to all the blank elements in the Butcher tableau. This can be removed using the <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">minus</Font> operator.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L488" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">unknowns := unknowns minus {``};</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSl1bmtub3duc0dGKDwmJkkmYWxwaGFHRig2JCIiIyIiIiZJImJHRig2I0YzJkY1NiNGMiZJImNHRihGODcjRi4=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L499" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">We now need to construct an expression for the local error. First, we form the LHS<Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>RHS of <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">evolve</Font>.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L480" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">Error := (lhs-rhs)(evolve);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="">LV9JLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nRzYkJSpwcm90ZWN0ZWRHSShfc3lzbGliRzYiSSxtcHJpbnRzbGFzaEdGKDYkNyM+SSZFcnJvckdGKCwoJkkieUdGKDYjLCZJImlHRigiIiJGNEY0RjQmRjA2I0YzISIiKiZJImhHRihGNCwmKiYmSSJiR0YoNiNGNEY0Jkkia0dGKEY+RjRGNComJkY9NiMiIiNGNCZGQEZDRjRGNEY0Rjc3I0Yu</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L408" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Then, let us substitute in the <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82JlEibkYnRjJGNUY4RjJGNUY4LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtRi82JlEibkYnRjJGNUY4RjJGNUY4LyUvc3Vic2NyaXB0c2hpZnRHUSIwRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRic=</Equation> definitions (we convert <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">k_def</Font> to a list first so we can put them all in at once).</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L481" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">Error := subs(convert(k_def, list), Error);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display=""></Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L414" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Actually, we see in this expression that there is still a <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtSSNtbkdGJDYlUSIxRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRidGMkY1RjgvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y1RkE=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtSSNtbkdGJDYlUSIxRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRidGMkY1RjgvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y1RkE=</Equation> (due to the fact that the definition of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtSSNtbkdGJDYlUSIyRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRidGMkY1RjgvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y1RkE=">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYlLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JlEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUrZXhlY3V0YWJsZUdRJmZhbHNlRicvJSxtYXRodmFyaWFudEdRJ2l0YWxpY0YnLUYjNiYtSSNtbkdGJDYlUSIyRidGNS9GOVEnbm9ybWFsRidGMkY1RjgvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y1RkE=</Equation> has <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> in it), so we need to do this again.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
